  "status": "Early Android launch capture, pre-engine Compatibility fallback and retained native-report export validated on Retroid Pocket 5. The Redmagic-specific driver fault remains unverified.",
  "implementation": [
    "Application.onCreate registers a main-process session and atomically persists its journal before Activity/native engine initialization.",
    "The plugin arms the attempt before GodotLib.initialize and updates setup/main-loop stages. A helper-only process that never attempts the engine is excluded from failed-launch recovery.",
    "An interrupted Mobile or Forward+ launch resets renderer.cfg to Compatibility before the next engine initialization. Both a pending trial and a previously confirmed choice are covered; saves and other settings are unchanged.",
    "The regular crash reporter reuses the early session token and completes the Java handoff only after its matching marker is written.",
    "Up to four failures retain requested renderer, phase, version/device and matching Android exit/native trace. Changed early engine-log tails are bounded to 64 KiB. Cached native traces remain usable when OS history expires.",
    "Failed export, clipboard copy and clean restart retain diagnostics. Successful file export verifies the write and acknowledges only included failures."
  ],
